In this file, you can find the results of the simulations for the envelope of the electric field

The simulation of the enevelope of the electric field does not contain plasma

This means that the plasma term has been turned off

It only simulates transversal diffraction, GVD, Kerr, and MPA

The sweep was done from Pin = 0.1 * Pcr to 20 * Pcr, with increments of 0.1 * Pcr
